repository-code: "https://github.com/iskenderozkul/robosimu"
url: "https://iskenderozkul.github.io/robosimu/"
abstract: >-
  Dependency-light rigid-body simulator for six-axis and human-like arms with
  per-joint motor and drive models, and an oracle-free visual reaching
  controller (İskender Governor, a perceptual 1/e speed governor) that sees only pixels and timestamps.
  Includes the benchmark, ablations, exact-boundary theory and an interactive
  browser-based 3D workbench.
